=> What is Windows Server?

You already know Linux Server.

For example, you may have:

Ubuntu/RHEL Server
       |
       +-- SSH
       +-- users
       +-- groups
       +-- permissions
       +-- services
       +-- networking
       +-- logs

Windows Server is similar in the overall purpose:

Windows Server
       |
       +-- Users
       +-- Groups
       +-- Services
       +-- Networking
       +-- Security
       +-- Logs
       +-- File sharing
       +-- Active Directory

The biggest difference for your learning is Active Directory.
